<BaseLayout title="Privacy & your puzzle break — Pocket Puzzle" description="How Pocket Puzzle loads external games, game artwork and fonts, and what happens when you choose to play." canonicalPath="/privacy/"><article class="legal-page"><h1>Privacy & your puzzle break</h1><p>Pocket Puzzle does not include an account system, a mailing list or our own analytics, and this website does not set its own cookies.</p><h2>When a page loads</h2><p>Game artwork is requested from HTMLGames, and fonts are requested from Google Fonts. These external services receive the network information needed to deliver their files, including your IP address.</p><h2>Advertising on this site</h2><p>Pocket Puzzle displays third-party ads served by Adsterra outside the game player. These ads load with the page. Adsterra and its advertising partners may use cookies, device identifiers and similar technologies to deliver and measure ads. Read the <a href="https://adsterra.com/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Adsterra privacy policy</a> for details and opt-out choices.</p><h2>When you choose Play</h2><p>The game connects to HTMLGames and its advertising services. The provider may use cookies or browser storage for game progress, analytics and advertising. Follow any privacy choices shown within its player. Choosing Play loads third-party content; it is not a blanket acceptance of personalized advertising.</p><p>Read the <a href="https://www.htmlgames.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HTMLGames privacy statement</a> for its practices.</p><h2>Your click is the consent</h2><p>No game content or game-provider advertising loads until you press Play on a game. That click is your consent to connect to the provider for that game. If you never press Play, none of the provider’s game or advertising scripts run. Pocket Puzzle’s own page ads (served by Adsterra, outside the player) are separate and load with each page. Questions: <a href="mailto:contact@pocketpuzzle.games">contact@pocketpuzzle.games</a>.</p></article></BaseLayout>